      "fTerm": "ELECTRIC ELEMENTS<br><br><b><u>Note(s)</u></b><br><br><ul type=\"\"1\"\"><li>Processes involving only a single technical art, e.g. drying, coating, for which provision exists elsewhere are classified in the relevant class for that art.<b>[7]</b></li><li>Attention is drawn to the Notes following the titles of class <b>B81</b> and subclass <b>B81B</b> relating to &quot;microstructural devices&quot; and &quot;microstructural systems&quot;.</li></ul>",
