      "fTerm": "ELECTRIC INCANDESCENT LAMPS (details, apparatus or processes for manufacture applicable to both discharge devices and incandescent lamps <b>H01J</b>;  light sources using a combination of incandescent and other types of light generation <b>H01J 61/96</b>, <b>H05B 35/00</b>)<br><br><b><u>Note(s)</u></b><br><br><ul style=\"\"list-style:none\"\"><li>In this subclass, the following term is used with the meaning indicated:<ul type=\"\"disc\"\"><li>&quot;lamp&quot; includes tubes emitting ultraviolet or infrared light.</li></ul></li></ul><br><br><b><u>Subclass indexes</u></b><br><table width=\"100%\"><tr><td width=\"70%\"><p style=\"\"text-indent:1em;margin:0\"\">CHARACTERISED BY UTILISATION</td><tr><td width=\"70%\"><p style=\"\"text-indent:2em;margin:0\"\">General lighting; other lighting</td><td><b>5/00</b>; <b>7/00</b></td></p></tr></p></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\"><p style=\"\"text-indent:1em;margin:0\"\">CHARACTERISED BY THE INCANDESCENT BODY</td><tr><td width=\"70%\"><p style=\"\"text-indent:2em;margin:0\"\">Non-conductive; non-conductive in the cold state; multiple</td><td><b>11/00</b>; <b>13/00</b>; <b>9/00</b></td></p></tr></p></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\"><p style=\"\"text-indent:1em;margin:0\"\">DETAILS</td><td><b>1/00</b></td></p></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\"><p style=\"\"text-indent:1em;margin:0\"\">MANUFACTURE</td><td><b>3/00</b></td></p></tr></table>",
